flowchart TD
    P[Player] --> UI[Streamlit chat interface]
    UI --> PARSE[Action interpretation]
    PARSE --> PY[Python game engine]
    S[(Structured game state)] <--> PY
    RULES[Fixed puzzle rules and solutions] --> PY
    PY --> OUT[Validated game outcome]
    OUT --> N[Optional Gemini narration]
    N --> UI
    OUT --> UI
